{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Mumagi: Stellar Saviors </strong></i>is a co-op horde survivor where you can gather up to 4 players to take down celestial forces. Choose a magical girl, enhance your powers, and restore time and space to their natural order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat hordes of enemies, level up, and upgrade your magical girl. Choose enchantments that fit your unique playstyle, and take advantage of your magical girl's signature move. When you add friends to the mix, your character choices will impact your available enchantments, unlocking new combinations to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celestial beings have warped time and space in order to create a universe under their control! However, their meddling has backfired against them: magical girls from various timelines and universes have suddenly found themselves gathered together. With their combined power, they may just be enough to take down the celestial beings and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players can play together in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique magical girls with their own powers and stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple maps with unique bosses to challenge and conquer</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689240?t=1745987268","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689240?t=1745987268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/f9934527854841c72297c3ca41ee08e994bf7e9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745987268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/f9934527854841c72297c3ca41ee08e994bf7e9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745987268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Mumagi: Stellar Saviors </strong></i>is a co-op horde survivor where you can gather up to 4 players to take down celestial forces. Choose a magical girl, enhance your powers, and restore time and space to their natural order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat hordes of enemies, level up, and upgrade your magical girl. Choose enchantments that fit your unique playstyle, and take advantage of your magical girl's signature move. When you add friends to the mix, your character choices will impact your available enchantments, unlocking new combinations to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celestial beings have warped time and space in order to create a universe under their control! However, their meddling has backfired against them: magical girls from various timelines and universes have suddenly found themselves gathered together. With their combined power, they may just be enough to take down the celestial beings and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players can play together in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique magical girls with their own powers and stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple maps with unique bosses to challenge and conquer</p></li></ul>","developers":["Saffrona","Qwerty"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id